{"id":202,"slug":"202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Kiểu Dữ Liệu & Biến","level":"beginner","question_vi":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?","question_en":"What are the primitive data types in JavaScript?","answer_vi":"JavaScript có 7 kiểu nguyên thuỷ: `string`, `number`, `boolean`, `null`, `undefined`, `symbol`, `bigint`.\n\nĐặc điểm chung: **bất biến và sao chép theo giá trị**.\n\n```javascript\nlet a = 5\nlet b = a          // copy giá trị\nb = 10\nconsole.log(a)     // 5 — a không bị ảnh hưởng\n\nconst o1 = { n: 5 }\nconst o2 = o1      // copy THAM CHIẾU\no2.n = 10\nconsole.log(o1.n)  // 10 — cùng một object\n```\n\nKhông phải nguyên thuỷ: `object`, `array`, `function`, `Date`, `Map`, `Set` — tất cả đều là object và sao chép theo tham chiếu.\n\n```javascript\ntypeof 'a'        // 'string'\ntypeof 1n         // 'bigint'\ntypeof Symbol()   // 'symbol'\ntypeof null       // 'object'  ← lỗi lịch sử của JS, không sửa được vì phá code cũ\ntypeof undefined  // 'undefined'\n```\n\n**Hay bị hỏi tiếp:** \"nguyên thuỷ không có method, sao `'abc'.toUpperCase()` chạy được?\" — JS **tự bọc tạm** giá trị vào object wrapper (`String`) khi gọi method, xong thì bỏ. Vì vậy gán thuộc tính lên nguyên thuỷ không có tác dụng:\n\n```javascript\nconst s = 'abc'\ns.foo = 1            // sloppy: lặng lẽ bỏ qua; strict/module: TypeError\nconsole.log(s.foo)   // undefined (sloppy) — wrapper đã bị huỷ\n```","answer_en":"JavaScript has 7 primitive types: `string`, `number`, `boolean`, `null`, `undefined`, `symbol`, `bigint`.\n\nWhat they share: they are **immutable and copied by value**.\n\n```javascript\nlet a = 5\nlet b = a          // copies the value\nb = 10\nconsole.log(a)     // 5 — a is untouched\n\nconst o1 = { n: 5 }\nconst o2 = o1      // copies the REFERENCE\no2.n = 10\nconsole.log(o1.n)  // 10 — the same object\n```\n\nNot primitives: `object`, `array`, `function`, `Date`, `Map`, `Set` — all objects, all copied by reference.\n\n```javascript\ntypeof 'a'        // 'string'\ntypeof 1n         // 'bigint'\ntypeof Symbol()   // 'symbol'\ntypeof null       // 'object'  <- a historical JS bug, unfixable without breaking the web\ntypeof undefined  // 'undefined'\n```\n\n**The usual follow-up:** \"if primitives have no methods, why does `'abc'.toUpperCase()` work?\" — JS **temporarily boxes** the value in a wrapper object (`String`) for the call and discards it afterwards. That is why assigning a property to a primitive does nothing:\n\n```javascript\nconst s = 'abc'\ns.foo = 1            // sloppy: silently ignored; strict/module: TypeError\nconsole.log(s.foo)   // undefined (sloppy) — the wrapper is gone\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">JavaScript có 7 kiểu nguyên thuỷ: <code>string</code>, <code>number</code>, <code>boolean</code>, <code>null</code>, <code>undefined</code>, <code>symbol</code>, <code>bigint</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Đặc điểm chung: <strong>bất biến và sao chép theo giá trị</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"let a = 5\nlet b = a          // copy giá trị\nb = 10\nconsole.log(a)     // 5 — a không bị ảnh hưởng\n\nconst o1 = { n: 5 }\nconst o2 = o1      // copy THAM CHIẾU\no2.n = 10\nconsole.log(o1.n)  // 10 — cùng một object\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> a = <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> b = a          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// copy giá trị</span>\nb = <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(a)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 5 — a không bị ảnh hưởng</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> o1 = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">n</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span> }\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> o2 = o1      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// copy THAM CHIẾU</span>\no2.<span class=\"hljs-property\">n</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(o1.<span class=\"hljs-property\">n</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 10 — cùng một object</span></code></pre></div><p>Không phải nguyên thuỷ: <code>object</code>, <code>array</code>, <code>function</code>, <code>Date</code>, <code>Map</code>, <code>Set</code> — tất cả đều là object và sao chép theo tham chiếu.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"typeof 'a'        // 'string'\ntypeof 1n         // 'bigint'\ntypeof Symbol()   // 'symbol'\ntypeof null       // 'object'  ← lỗi lịch sử của JS, không sửa được vì phá code cũ\ntypeof undefined  // 'undefined'\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;string&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1n</span>         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;bigint&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Symbol</span>()   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;symbol&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;object&#x27;  ← lỗi lịch sử của JS, không sửa được vì phá code cũ</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;undefined&#x27;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Hay bị hỏi tiếp:</strong> \"nguyên thuỷ không có method, sao <code>'abc'.toUpperCase()</code> chạy được?\" — JS <strong>tự bọc tạm</strong> giá trị vào object wrapper (<code>String</code>) khi gọi method, xong thì bỏ.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Vì vậy gán thuộc tính lên nguyên thuỷ không có tác dụng:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const s = 'abc'\ns.foo = 1            // sloppy: lặng lẽ bỏ qua; strict/module: TypeError\nconsole.log(s.foo)   // undefined (sloppy) — wrapper đã bị huỷ\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> s = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;abc&#x27;</span>\ns.<span class=\"hljs-property\">foo</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// sloppy: lặng lẽ bỏ qua; strict/module: TypeError</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(s.<span class=\"hljs-property\">foo</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// undefined (sloppy) — wrapper đã bị huỷ</span></code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">JavaScript has 7 primitive types: <code>string</code>, <code>number</code>, <code>boolean</code>, <code>null</code>, <code>undefined</code>, <code>symbol</code>, <code>bigint</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">What they share: they are <strong>immutable and copied by value</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"let a = 5\nlet b = a          // copies the value\nb = 10\nconsole.log(a)     // 5 — a is untouched\n\nconst o1 = { n: 5 }\nconst o2 = o1      // copies the REFERENCE\no2.n = 10\nconsole.log(o1.n)  // 10 — the same object\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> a = <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> b = a          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// copies the value</span>\nb = <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(a)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 5 — a is untouched</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> o1 = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">n</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span> }\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> o2 = o1      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// copies the REFERENCE</span>\no2.<span class=\"hljs-property\">n</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(o1.<span class=\"hljs-property\">n</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 10 — the same object</span></code></pre></div><p>Not primitives: <code>object</code>, <code>array</code>, <code>function</code>, <code>Date</code>, <code>Map</code>, <code>Set</code> — all objects, all copied by reference.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"typeof 'a'        // 'string'\ntypeof 1n         // 'bigint'\ntypeof Symbol()   // 'symbol'\ntypeof null       // 'object'  &lt;- a historical JS bug, unfixable without breaking the web\ntypeof undefined  // 'undefined'\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;string&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1n</span>         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;bigint&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Symbol</span>()   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;symbol&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;object&#x27;  &lt;- a historical JS bug, unfixable without breaking the web</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">undefined</span>  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;undefined&#x27;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>The usual follow-up:</strong> \"if primitives have no methods, why does <code>'abc'.toUpperCase()</code> work?\" — JS <strong>temporarily boxes</strong> the value in a wrapper object (<code>String</code>) for the call and discards it afterwards.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">That is why assigning a property to a primitive does nothing:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const s = 'abc'\ns.foo = 1            // sloppy: silently ignored; strict/module: TypeError\nconsole.log(s.foo)   // undefined (sloppy) — the wrapper is gone\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> s = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;abc&#x27;</span>\ns.<span class=\"hljs-property\">foo</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// sloppy: silently ignored; strict/module: TypeError</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(s.<span class=\"hljs-property\">foo</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// undefined (sloppy) — the wrapper is gone</span></code></pre></div>","references":[{"label":"MDN — JavaScript data types and data structures","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Data_structures"},{"label":"MDN — typeof","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/typeof"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/212-temporal-dead-zone-tdz-la-gi","title":"Temporal Dead Zone (TDZ) là gì?"}]}